{
  "id": "kyemfil",
  "title": "CHAPTER 4: POLITY AND ADMINISTRATION",
  "order": 4,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "6ut2e7j",
      "content": "Andhra Pradesh follows the parliamentary system of government as laid down by the Constitution of India. The state has a unicameral legislature (Vidhan Sabha only, though historically it also had a Vidhan Parishad / Legislative Council which was abolished and later reconstituted)."
    },
